"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"returns","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Returns"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"Promise"},{"type":"text","value":"<{\n"},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"aguiContext"},{"type":"text","value":": "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"Context"},{"type":"text","value":"[];\n"},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"context"},{"type":"text","value":": "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"Context"},{"type":"text","value":"[];\n"},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"forwardedProps"},{"type":"text","value":": "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"Record"},{"type":"text","value":"<"},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"string"},{"type":"text","value":", "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"unknown"},{"type":"text","value":">;\n"},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"messages"},{"type":"text","value":": (\n| "},{"type":"link","href":"../interfaces/UIMessage.md","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"UIMessage"}]},{"type":"text","value":"<"},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"unknown"},{"type":"text","value":">\n| "},{"type":"link","href":"../interfaces/ModelMessage.md","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"ModelMessage"}]},{"type":"text","value":"<\n| "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"string"},{"type":"text","value":"\n| "},{"type":"link","href":"../type-aliases/ContentPart.md","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"ContentPart"}]},{"type":"text","value":"<"},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"unknown"},{"type":"text","value":", "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"unknown"},{"type":"text","value":", "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"unknown"},{"type":"text","value":", "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"unknown"},{"type":"text","value":", "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"unknown"},{"type":"text","value":">[]\n| "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"null"},{"type":"text","value":">)[];\n"},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"parentRunId?"},{"type":"text","value":": "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"string"},{"type":"text","value":";\n"},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"resume?"},{"type":"text","value":": "},{"type":"link","href":"../type-aliases/RunAgentResumeItem.md","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"RunAgentResumeItem"}]},{"type":"text","value":"[];\n"},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"runId"},{"type":"text","value":": "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"string"},{"type":"text","value":";\n"},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"state"},{"type":"text","value":": "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"unknown"},{"type":"text","value":";\n"},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"threadId"},{"type":"text","value":": "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"string"},{"type":"text","value":";\n"},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"tools"},{"type":"text","value":": "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"object"},{"type":"text","value":"[];\n}>"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"throws","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Throws"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"An error with a migration-pointing message when the body does\nnot conform to AG-UI "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"RunAgentInput"},{"type":"text","value":". Surface this as a\n400 Bad Request to the client."}]}],"headings":[{"id":"parameters","text":"Parameters","level":2},{"id":"body","text":"body","level":3},{"id":"returns","text":"Returns","level":2},{"id":"throws","text":"Throws","level":2}]},"frameworks":[],"downloadMarkdown":"\n```ts\nfunction chatParamsFromRequestBody(body): Promise<{\n  aguiContext: Context[];\n  context: Context[];\n  forwardedProps: Record<string, unknown>;\n  messages: (\n     | UIMessage<unknown>\n     | ModelMessage<\n     | string\n     | ContentPart<unknown, unknown, unknown, unknown, unknown>[]\n    | null>)[];\n  parentRunId?: string;\n  resume?: RunAgentResumeItem[];\n  runId: string;\n  state: unknown;\n  threadId: string;\n  tools: object[];\n}>;\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/ai/src/utilities/chat-params.ts:204](https://github.com/TanStack/ai/blob/main/packages/ai/src/utilities/chat-params.ts#L204)\n\nParse and validate an HTTP request body as an AG-UI `RunAgentInput`.\n\nReturns a spread-friendly object whose `messages` field is suitable for\npassing directly to `chat({ messages })`. The existing\n`convertMessagesToModelMessages` handles AG-UI fan-out dedup and\nreasoning/activity/developer-role normalization internally.\n\nValidated structurally against the AG-UI `RunAgentInput` contract without a\nschema library, so this package pulls in no validation runtime of its own.\n\n## Parameters\n\n### body\n\n`unknown`\n\n## Returns\n\n`Promise`\\<\\{\n  `aguiContext`: `Context`[];\n  `context`: `Context`[];\n  `forwardedProps`: `Record`\\<`string`, `unknown`\\>;\n  `messages`: (\n     \\| [`UIMessage`](../interfaces/UIMessage.md)\\<`unknown`\\>\n     \\| [`ModelMessage`](../interfaces/ModelMessage.md)\\<\n     \\| `string`\n     \\| [`ContentPart`](../type-aliases/ContentPart.md)\\<`unknown`, `unknown`, `unknown`, `unknown`, `unknown`\\>[]\n    \\| `null`\\>)[];\n  `parentRunId?`: `string`;\n  `resume?`: [`RunAgentResumeItem`](../type-aliases/RunAgentResumeItem.md)[];\n  `runId`: `string`;\n  `state`: `unknown`;\n  `threadId`: `string`;\n  `tools`: `object`[];\n\\}\\>\n\n## Throws\n\nAn error with a migration-pointing message when the body does\n  not conform to AG-UI `RunAgentInput`. Surface this as a\n  400 Bad Request to the client.\n","originalRawMarkdown":"---\nid: chatParamsFromRequestBody\ntitle: chatParamsFromRequestBody\n---\n\n```ts\nfunction chatParamsFromRequestBody(body): Promise<{\n  aguiContext: Context[];\n  context: Context[];\n  forwardedProps: Record<string, unknown>;\n  messages: (\n     | UIMessage<unknown>\n     | ModelMessage<\n     | string\n     | ContentPart<unknown, unknown, unknown, unknown, unknown>[]\n    | null>)[];\n  parentRunId?: string;\n  resume?: RunAgentResumeItem[];\n  runId: string;\n  state: unknown;\n  threadId: string;\n  tools: object[];\n}>;\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/ai/src/utilities/chat-params.ts:204](https://github.com/TanStack/ai/blob/main/packages/ai/src/utilities/chat-params.ts#L204)\n\nParse and validate an HTTP request body as an AG-UI `RunAgentInput`.\n\nReturns a spread-friendly object whose `messages` field is suitable for\npassing directly to `chat({ messages })`. The existing\n`convertMessagesToModelMessages` handles AG-UI fan-out dedup and\nreasoning/activity/developer-role normalization internally.\n\nValidated structurally against the AG-UI `RunAgentInput` contract without a\nschema library, so this package pulls in no validation runtime of its own.\n\n## Parameters\n\n### body\n\n`unknown`\n\n## Returns\n\n`Promise`\\<\\{\n  `aguiContext`: `Context`[];\n  `context`: `Context`[];\n  `forwardedProps`: `Record`\\<`string`, `unknown`\\>;\n  `messages`: (\n     \\| [`UIMessage`](../interfaces/UIMessage.md)\\<`unknown`\\>\n     \\| [`ModelMessage`](../interfaces/ModelMessage.md)\\<\n     \\| `string`\n     \\| [`ContentPart`](../type-aliases/ContentPart.md)\\<`unknown`, `unknown`, `unknown`, `unknown`, `unknown`\\>[]\n    \\| `null`\\>)[];\n  `parentRunId?`: `string`;\n  `resume?`: [`RunAgentResumeItem`](../type-aliases/RunAgentResumeItem.md)[];\n  `runId`: `string`;\n  `state`: `unknown`;\n  `threadId`: `string`;\n  `tools`: `object`[];\n\\}\\>\n\n## Throws\n\nAn error with a migration-pointing message when the body does\n  not conform to AG-UI `RunAgentInput`. Surface this as a\n  400 Bad Request to the client.\n"}
